{
 "batchId": "b-0636",
 "sourceSetHash": "c4fdf0823f71d922ef3a32035f235773397bf8c784a212b1d774134aa7899a89",
 "locale": "zh-Hans",
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_283c4208eb0f32c8b12f",
   "sourceHash": "283c4208eb0f32c8b12f1e218b55f2b51cd8ed7f2e36a1a49ec15dc14dbb35d8",
   "text": "潘查卡玛疗法 | Kairali 阿育吠陀疗愈村",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f355686507da8ec04d8d",
   "sourceHash": "f355686507da8ec04d8dfd6a4e9baa4a4d2144b4fed255371d5fe3719f2a0a4e",
   "text": "是否饱受持续头痛、关节疼痛、不明原因的倦怠、失眠和精神疲劳之苦？这些症状可能有多种原因，医师问诊是正确的第一步。通过喀拉拉邦一流的潘查卡玛治疗，体验全面的疗愈。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3a65e1cd04038a8f59d4",
   "sourceHash": "3a65e1cd04038a8f59d4432bfc513b70bc88b95ce8437d9c5efa7d970a96e54b",
   "text": "您是否摄入过多垃圾食品和含糖饮料？是否饮酒过量，损害了肝脏和肾脏？这些不良习惯会导致高胆固醇、心脏病、糖尿病和关节炎。在我们的阿育吠陀医院开始由医师指导的潘查卡玛方案吧。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_16ce814d7acd900c6897",
   "sourceHash": "16ce814d7acd900c68979812334c1bf82dfb51da2a157f6386a097c1db76b8d1",
   "text": "潘查卡玛方法借助身体的自然疗愈过程，帮助清除体内积聚的杂质和毒素。潘查卡玛是阿育吠陀促进长期健康的经典方法之一。与我们一起建立持久健康的生活，全面了解潘查卡玛治疗",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d4a3e00191197be36c07",
   "sourceHash": "d4a3e00191197be36c078e5df136dd39a1139ed11c2b35fd825cdcf9041c8053",
   "text": "独特之处",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6dad30bf975dd755d730",
   "sourceHash": "6dad30bf975dd755d730cf8f407495f46e291de49053249f8dad2124f847df29",
   "text": "走进自然",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_89e8689087fd62238cac",
   "sourceHash": "89e8689087fd62238cacc531c78d6450b931c2d89817abf4557e076f60541a6c",
   "text": "Kairali 喀拉拉邦潘查卡玛治疗：正宗排毒疗法、NABH 认证照护、瑜伽、舒适的别墅住宿和个性化阿育吠陀。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f3df9fcbc557ca9679d8",
   "sourceHash": "f3df9fcbc557ca9679d84562ce7bf5e4258bb8f8c7a4c419030af12525f32ee2",
   "text": "喀拉拉邦潘查卡玛治疗 | Kairali 疗愈村",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3490183f1d519fea0823",
   "sourceHash": "3490183f1d519fea0823db0b3835d9695a2def01dbf800d75ab312e073557a8d",
   "text": "Kairali（喀拉拉邦）为瘫痪患者提供由医师指导的阿育吠陀康复：潘查卡玛、瑜伽和草药照护，与医疗建议配合进行。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ea5876ac7b3e70b51691",
   "sourceHash": "ea5876ac7b3e70b51691f978acfeeab56bde6417ccd0f7bf57070bfb72c8a223",
   "text": "我们首先进行详细问诊，评估个人状况和潜在病因。随后进行个性化疗法，如 Abhyanga（药油按摩）、Shirodhara（希罗达拉，淋油疗法）和潘查卡玛（排毒），以恢复平衡、清除毒素。草药和 Rasayana（焕活疗法）将作为您方案的一部分开具。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6fee9ff7213447ba2a88",
   "sourceHash": "6fee9ff7213447ba2a88328e18258af39a861afc578262b4954a5adc7c8b9442",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]阿育吠陀会关注瘫痪的潜在因素以及您的整体健康。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_83607c1a815763b91abd",
   "sourceHash": "83607c1a815763b91abdb01765dfc970773209a066fdc6c897ce4f77411b486e",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]增强肌肉力量和活动能力的疗法与练习",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6f6838b65f7f74372d93",
   "sourceHash": "6f6838b65f7f74372d931e7e3a818ff7cff0995d78d25950dbb169fa7213c0b5",
   "text": "Kairali 瘫痪治疗患者体验",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e1c375bccda08798e21b",
   "sourceHash": "e1c375bccda08798e21b073c96e218eaf4c2f9885affdba12774639c0e5ffc8c",
   "text": "瘫痪康复疗法 – Pakshaghata Chikitsa（奇基察）",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_42f7afad0c8505a023a4",
   "sourceHash": "42f7afad0c8505a023a4019667419cbd054720a843bc7b217e9ed32ab32c2fab",
   "text": "阿育吠陀瘫痪康复照护 | Kairali",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3846f1402b1eee081f55",
   "sourceHash": "3846f1402b1eee081f55ce0a56bac4563d1af169a1f3f7b31f26f83cc87923b1",
   "text": "：在医师认为适当时，方案会纳入 Virechana（泻下疗法）和 Swedana（蒸汽发汗）等潘查卡玛疗法。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e5641248674baeeced16",
   "sourceHash": "e5641248674baeeced16871d2de64cb87efcce0fadf8b2e22115c1dfed3fa026",
   "text": "：医师会开具特定的草药配方和 Rasayana 疗法，以支持肌肉和关节。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_32b3c9c4e96148915d61",
   "sourceHash": "32b3c9c4e96148915d61ed96fd830c528e3aaaf7ba8b2a7734f88b6bba705950",
   "text": "：根据患者病情精心定制瑜伽方案，以支持柔韧性和力量。温和的物理治疗练习也有助于增强肌肉、改善活动能力。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c1b207abf9846182fee5",
   "sourceHash": "c1b207abf9846182fee5eb28383dfe9b32486f98e18b353140ca79508459046a",
   "text": "：提供定制饮食计划，并配合生活方式调整，以支持康复并预防进一步的并发症。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_96bfbdb56ec1cabf1394",
   "sourceHash": "96bfbdb56ec1cabf13945cc0f132823fca55ce1998ed9994a4fea1f582578535",
   "text": "Kairali 代表着逾 115 年的阿育吠陀疗愈传统，传承自喀拉拉邦丰富的医学渊源。疗愈村坐落于西高止山脉山麓 65 英亩的青翠土地上，依照 Vastu Shastra（瓦斯图建筑学）原则建造，环境宁静、悦性。来自世界各地的患者来到这里，针对各类健康问题接受由医生监督的正宗阿育吠陀疗法。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d914fbb4f8fed2564f6f",
   "sourceHash": "d914fbb4f8fed2564f6f031ad4cc229ec5bcfa7bd65303c3d786161d7391688f",
   "text": "显示视频来源链接：一位患者在 Kairali 的住院经历",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0cd8c3ea2fd18863759c",
   "sourceHash": "0cd8c3ea2fd18863759c930bf6aecb379d3cef3b6961f5be45daea3397abff0d",
   "text": "显示视频来源链接：一位患者在 Kairali 的潘查卡玛体验",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
}
